                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "RFK Jr.\u2019s decision to change the CDC website with his fringe, debunked belief that vaccines cause autism is a threat to our public health.\n\nHe\u2019s scaring parents, undermining trust in the CDC, and putting children at risk.\n\nThat is why my Democratic Doctors Caucus colleagues and I led 65 members to demand that RFK Jr. remove his dangerous anti-vaccine talking points.\nhttps://t.co/RSKNGESfOL",
